{
  "_doc": "Which journey is EXPECTED to trigger each live event from 'Audit | Jun 2026'. null journey = no journey reaches it, so silence is not evidence of a defect. `requires` names a field in that journey's result which must be truthy for the trigger to have actually occurred - a journey can run to completion without ever reaching the condition. `navigates` marks triggers where the click leaves the page, so a missing event may be a flush failure rather than a missing handler.",
